      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Though I'm not completely sure I'm experiencing the same issue, I have run into seemingly older avatars breaking other avatars from loading, and rejoining fixes it.  I'll pay more attention if/when this happens in the future.\n\n(I've also had the problem where voice and avatar motion continues to work in VRChat, but even the rejoin instance button fails and I have to relaunch VRChat to restore functionality.  I think that is unrelated as it infrequently happened before the Open Beta too, hence not reporting this sooner as I wasn't sure on the cause.)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
