  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-09-15T20:20:04.474Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When one player loads into a very old avatar that appears broken in the beta, (for example the public avatar avtr_6cb10461-e3ff-4871-a679-a00d7148b378)\n\nthe loading for this avatar on remote clients will be stuck and the loading of other avatars in the instance becomes completely stalled or broken until you rejoin the instance. \n\nSo you won't be able to see most avatars in an instance if one player is in an old avatar with this issue.\n\nIt appears to maybe be related to an API issue for this avatar. An error in the logs indicate an HTTPS transport issue when this avatar loads. Perhaps the avatar download queue stops due to the unexpected HTTPS transport error. \n\nLogs: https://pastebin.com/P1t9zWw9",
